  "description": "As KS-25p, but the recovery rotation seals something else, so the only seal of the ACDC is in the superseded interaction, seen but off the trunk. A validator that searches every seen event for the seal accepts an ACDC sealed with a key the issuer has recovered from, which is the forgery line 1663 says the seal protects against. Only a validator that performs the recovery can tell, so the case requires kel.recovery. Its positive pair is KS-25p (ACDC-0065), which differs from it only in the defect.",
